  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">re.green - Reforestation Equity in Brazil</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IDB Invest is considering a co-lead equity investment in re.green for an amount of up to US$15 million. Founded in 2021, re.green is a Brazilian nature-based solutions companywith the goal of restoringone million hectares in the Amazon and Atlantic Forest regions.The Project supports the scale-up of science-led, technology-enabled forest restoration with silvicultural practices in Brazil and the supply of high-integrity carbon removal credits backed by long-term corporate offtake agreements. Its development objectives are to accelerate restoration of degraded land with native species and robust ecological monitoring, and to mobilize private capital by demonstrating a replicable model that couples biodiversity and social co-benefits with premium, verified carbon credits.</narrative>
  </description>
